{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, cute, colorful 2D platformer inspired by the energy and exploration of Kirby's Adventure. The round structure borrows ideas from Star Fox 64 - you pick your path through a series of levels in pursuit of a high score. The levels themselves meanwhile blend the sprawling nature of Sonic 1's levels with the room-structure of Kirby's Adventure's levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/ccfdda82bd20af47258343b5d374e5fd.poster.avif?t=1759103066\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/ccfdda82bd20af47258343b5d374e5fd.webm?t=1759103066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/ccfdda82bd20af47258343b5d374e5fd.mp4?t=1759103066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run</strong> through <strong>SHORT, SNAPPY</strong> levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/fb517b468f621886938b2da8683ce9d0.poster.avif?t=1759103066\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/fb517b468f621886938b2da8683ce9d0.webm?t=1759103066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/fb517b468f621886938b2da8683ce9d0.mp4?t=1759103066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> a team of four characters to take on the evil king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/dc98f560cc459c44aba902112e5095af.poster.avif?t=1759103066\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/dc98f560cc459c44aba902112e5095af.webm?t=1759103066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/dc98f560cc459c44aba902112e5095af.mp4?t=1759103066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick</strong> your path through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/33e6f244080b37e96d95dfe5e4f13523.poster.avif?t=1759103066\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/33e6f244080b37e96d95dfe5e4f13523.webm?t=1759103066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/33e6f244080b37e96d95dfe5e4f13523.mp4?t=1759103066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> each level with its many paths, looking for <strong>SECRETS</strong> around every turn.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level Select Unlocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2836060/b2942f7b8a0331bf95eac3e74a6d60726fe98189.jpg"},{"name":"Dojo Unlocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2836060/9cb06ddab4f1f0676a8234dba62f4a6ed61c7d54.j